        "`cball_pow(a, b)`: principal complex power `a^b` over complex balls `list(re, im, rad)`. Complex power `self^exponent = exp(exponent * ln(self))`.",
        "`cball_powi(z, n)`: integer power enclosure `z^n` of `list(re, im, rad)`. Integer power `self^n`. Returns `None` if `!self.is_finite()` or if `n < 0` and `self` may contain zero.",
        "`cball_sin(z)`: complex sine enclosure of `list(re, im, rad)`. Complex sine `sin(z)`.",
