        "`check_analytic(f, z)`: `true` if `f(z)` satisfies the Cauchy-Riemann equations, `false` otherwise.",
        "`check_jacobi(basis[, coords])`: `true` if the Jacobi identity `[x, [y, z]] + [y, [z, x]] + [z, [x, y]] = 0` holds for all basis triples, `false` otherwise.",
        "`chi(x)`: hyperbolic cosine integral `Chi(x) = gamma + ln|x| + int_0^x (cosh(t) - 1)/t dt`.",
        "`chi_squared(k)`: chi-squared distribution with `k` degrees of freedom.",
        "`chi_squared_test(observed, expected)`: Pearson's chi-squared goodness-of-fit test returning `list(statistic, p_value)`. Performs a chi-squared goodness-of-fit test. Tests if observed frequencies match expected frequencies. Returns (chi-squared statistic, p-value).",
        "`cholesky(A)`: lower-triangular Cholesky factor `L` with `A = L L^T` for positive-definite `A`. Cholesky factor `L` (lower triangular) with `A = L L^T`. # Errors [`DenseError::Singular`] if `A` is not symmetric positive definite.",
        "`chordal_distance(z1, z2)`: spherical chordal distance `2*abs(z1 - z2) / sqrt((1 + abs(z1)^2)*(1 + abs(z2)^2))` on `S^2`. Spherical chordal distance on the Riemann sphere: `2 * |z1 - z2| / sqrt((1 + |z1|^2) * (1 + |z2|^2))`. Overflow-safe for large moduli.",
        "`christoffel(g, vars)`: Christoffel symbols of the second kind `Gamma^k_ij` for metric `g` in `vars`.",
        "`christoffel1(g, vars)`: Christoffel symbols of the first kind `Gamma_kij` for metric `g` in `vars`.",
        "`ci(x)`: cosine integral `Ci(x) = -int_x^infty cos(t)/t dt`.",
        "`cinterval_acos(z)`: principal inverse cosine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of principal `acos(z) = pi/2 - asin(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_acosh(z)`: principal inverse hyperbolic cosine enclosure of dimensionless bounds `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Symbolic calls stay unevaluated when a bound cannot be formed. Checked calls report a domain diagnostic. Rectangular enclosure of principal `acosh(z) = ln(z + sqrt(z - 1) * sqrt(z + 1))`.",
        "`cinterval_add(a, b)`: sum of two complex intervals `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`.",
        "`cinterval_asin(z)`: principal inverse sine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of principal `asin(z) = -i * ln(i*z + sqrt(1 - z^2))`.",
        "`cinterval_asinh(z)`: principal inverse hyperbolic sine enclosure of dimensionless bounds `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Symbolic calls stay unevaluated when a bound cannot be formed. Checked calls report a domain diagnostic. Rectangular enclosure of principal `asinh(z) = ln(z + sqrt(z^2 + 1))`.",
        "`cinterval_atan(z)`: principal inverse tangent enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of principal `atan(z) = (i/2) * ln((1 - i*z)/(1 + i*z))`.",
        "`cinterval_atanh(z)`: principal inverse hyperbolic tangent enclosure of dimensionless bounds `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Symbolic calls stay unevaluated when a bound cannot be formed. Checked calls report a domain diagnostic. Rectangular enclosure of principal `atanh(z) = 0.5 * ln((1 + z)/(1 - z))`.",
        "`cinterval_cos(z)`: complex cosine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of `cos(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_cosh(z)`: complex hyperbolic cosine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of `cosh(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_div(a, b)`: quotient of two complex intervals `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. `self / other`. Returns `None` when the denominator enclosure cannot be separated from zero.",
        "`cinterval_exp(z)`: complex exponential enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of `exp(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_intersect(a, b)`: intersection of two rectangular complex intervals. The intersection, when the rectangles meet.",
        "`cinterval_ln(z)`: principal complex logarithm enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of principal `ln(z)`. Returns `None` if the rectangle meets the non-positive real axis `(-inf, 0]`.",
        "`cinterval_mul(a, b)`: product of two complex intervals `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`.",
        "`cinterval_pow(a, b)`: principal complex power enclosure `a^b`. Rectangular enclosure of `self^exponent = exp(exponent * ln(self))`.",
        "`cinterval_sin(z)`: complex sine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of `sin(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_sinh(z)`: complex hyperbolic sine enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of `sinh(z)`.",
        "`cinterval_sqrt(z)`: principal complex square root enclosure of `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)`. Rectangular enclosure of principal `sqrt(z)`. Returns `None` if the rectangle crosses `(-inf, 0)` away from `0`.",
