        "`cinterval_to_cball(rect)`: converts a rectangular complex interval `list(re_lo, re_hi, im_lo, im_hi)` to a complex ball `list(re, im, rad)`. Converts a rectangular [`Cball`] into an enclosing [`ComplexBall`].",
