        "Native finite-element model in an explicit Length/Time/Mass/Temperature frame. All numeric coefficients/coordinates/displacements are normalized by the corresponding derived references. Results retain physical reference metadata; beam matrices expose heterogeneous translation/rotation DOF references and their quadratic-form reference. Computes element stresses given nodal displacements. # Panics Panics if the number of displacements is not 6.",
        "Native finite-element model in an explicit Length/Time/Mass/Temperature frame. All numeric coefficients/coordinates/displacements are normalized by the corresponding derived references. Results retain physical reference metadata; beam matrices expose heterogeneous translation/rotation DOF references and their quadratic-form reference. Computes the constitutive (D) matrix for plane stress or plane strain.",
        "Native finite-element model in an explicit Length/Time/Mass/Temperature frame. All numeric coefficients/coordinates/displacements are normalized by the corresponding derived references. Results retain physical reference metadata; beam matrices expose heterogeneous translation/rotation DOF references and their quadratic-form reference. Computes the local stiffness matrix (6x6).",
