        "Native structured PDE method in the grid reference frame; normalized numeric inputs are converted to coherent callback coordinates and checked physical callback output domains. Callback and discretization work are bounded; native boundary errors propagate. Assembles the operator for a node-sampled diffusivity. # Errors If `alpha` does not have one value per node, is negative or not finite, if a Robin condition is nonfinite or degenerate, or if the boundary periodicity differs from the grid's.",
        "Native structured PDE method in the grid reference frame; normalized numeric inputs are converted to coherent callback coordinates and checked physical callback output domains. Callback and discretization work are bounded; native boundary errors propagate. Overwrites Dirichlet nodes of `u` with `g(t, x)`.",
