        "Return the rank of a rectangular integer matrix of at most 128 by 128 over a prime field. The modulus is an exact prime in the unsigned 64-bit range. Negative entries and characteristic two are supported. The rank of a rectangular integer matrix over the field with prime modulus `p`. Binary elimination packs 64 columns into each machine word. # Panics Panics for ragged rows or a modulus below two. The caller must supply a prime.",
