        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. The point `re + i im`.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. A rectangular enclosure of `z^n` by binary exponentiation.",
