        "Explicit checked native device adapter. Machine IR and buffers use normalized coordinates; use physical map for independently measured columns. Session, shape and bounded work are validated before native execution. Number of elements.",
        "Explicit native array/device object specialization. IR, buffer and generic storage values are normalized; physical programs retain their tape reference frame. Shapes and native execution work are bounded before launch. Wraps device storage. For [`Device`] implementors.",
        "Explicit checked native device adapter. Machine IR and buffers use normalized coordinates; use physical map for independently measured columns. Session, shape and bounded work are validated before native execution. The [`DeviceInfo`]-independent unique number of the owning device.",
        "Explicit native array/device object specialization. IR, buffer and generic storage values are normalized; physical programs retain their tape reference frame. Shapes and native execution work are bounded before launch. The device-private storage.",
