        "Explicit native backend specialization. Feature-disabled JIT/GPU builds return Unsupported; machine representations are normalized and source, row, fold-work and allocation budgets are checked. Runs rows `row_lo .. row_lo + out[0].len()`; `false` when the code bailed (the caller then interprets the launch).",
