        "Native scaled global/constrained optimization with shared actual host evaluation limit. Nelder: x,xscale,yscale,step,tol,iterations,budget,f. Differential evolution: lo,hi,xscale,yscale,population,generations,budget,seed,f. Annealing: x,xscale,yscale,step,temperature,cooling,iterations,budget,seed,f. Constrained: x,xscale,yscale,equality_scale,inequality_scale,tol,iterations,budget,f,eq,ineq. Constraints independently carry C/H units; SQP returns physical multipliers E/C and E/H, native status and second-order verdict. Second-order: x,lambda,mu,xscale,yscale,eqscale,ineqscale,budget,f,eq,ineq. No global-optimality claim; native iteration/status semantics retained. Differential evolution (`rand/1/bin`) within box `bounds`, seeded.",
        "Construct the native dimensionless Dirichlet simplex distribution with positive concentration parameters.",
