        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Creates an RGB color with alpha = 1.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the cross product of two 3D vectors.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the (scalar) cross product `x1 y2 - y1 x2` of two 2D vectors, the `z` component of the 3D cross product of their embeddings.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Dimension-generic dot product: dispatches on the vector type.",
