        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Linear interpolation between two vectors.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 look-at view matrix. # Arguments * `eye` - Camera position. * `center` - Point the camera is looking at. * `up` - Up direction vector.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 orthographic projection matrix.",
