        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes ray-plane intersection.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes ray-sphere intersection. Returns the closest intersection with t > 0, or `None` if no intersection.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Intersects a ray with a triangle using a minimum ray parameter of `1e-6`. Use [`PreparedTriangle`] to reuse triangle geometry or specify another parameter range. The returned normal follows the vertex winding.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the reflection of a vector about a normal. R = I - 2(N\u00b7I)N, where I is the incident vector and N is the normal.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Computes the refraction of a vector through a surface. Uses Snell's law with `eta` = n1/n2 (ratio of refractive indices). Returns `None` for total internal reflection.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 rotation matrix around an arbitrary axis. Uses the Rodrigues' rotation formula.",
