        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Generates a 4x4 shearing matrix. # Arguments * `xy` - Shear X by Y * `xz` - Shear X by Z * `yx` - Shear Y by X * `yz` - Shear Y by Z * `zx` - Shear Z by X * `zy` - Shear Z by Y",
