        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. A backend whose cache keys are mixed with `key_extra`. Pass [`target_key`] combined with the manifest hash: `backend = CraneliftBackend::with_key(manifest.hash_u64() ^ target_key())`.",
        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. Compiles `tape` (which should already be optimised). # Errors [`BackendError::Codegen`] when Cranelift rejects the program or the host is unsupported, or the tape fails structural/arity validation.",
