        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. Calls `func` with `args` in machine code. # Errors The arguments do not match the function (see [`Module::check_args`]).",
        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. Verifies and compiles every function of `module`. # Errors The module does not verify, or Cranelift rejects it.",
