        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. Run until a result or until the next jump would exceed `fuel`. Returns `None` for a mismatched input count.",
        "Actual feature-gated native JIT adapter. Requires RSSN jit; disabled builds return Unsupported. Compiled expression calls retain physical tape frames; low-level LIR has explicit normalized values and bounded acyclic control flow. A stable identifier for the machine this code will run on. The value is a hash of the target triple and the CPU feature set the compiler was configured with, so two builds for different micro- architectures do not share cached machine code.",
