        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Returns the reverse of the multivector. The reverse operation reverses the order of products of basis vectors. For G3: s, v1, v2, v3 are unchanged; b12, b23, b31, pss are negated. Wait, `reverse(e_i` `e_j`) = `e_j` `e_i` = -`e_i` `e_j`. So bivectors are negated. `reverse(e_1` `e_2` `e_3`) = `e_3` `e_2` `e_1` = -`e_1` `e_2` `e_3`. So pseudoscalar is negated.",
        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Performs the outer (wedge) product.",
