        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Direct `O(N^2)` field of all sources at every body, excluding its own contribution. Use [`direct_field_into`] when the input lengths need to be checked or the output storage is already available. `eps` sets the Plummer softening length by its magnitude. Distinct coincident bodies with zero softening have an undefined pair contribution (`NaN`). # Panics Panics in positive dimensions if there are at least two bodies and `src` is shorter than `pos`.",
