        "Checked native method over explicitly normalized values. Session/kind, shape and work/allocation bounds are enforced. Merge another independent accumulator into this one. # Errors Reports a dimension mismatch, count overflow, or arithmetic overflow.",
        "Create an online accumulator for homogeneous observation units specified by a positive reference quantity. Coherent means retain those units and covariance squares them. Construct an empty accumulator for `dimension` variables. # Errors Returns [`OnlineStatsError::InvalidDimension`] for zero or an unallocatable matrix size.",
