        "Encodes a tensor of exact bytes using a retained Reed\u2013Solomon encoder. The result begins with the original bytes and ends with the prepared parity count. Input and output have no physical units. Encodes `message` as data followed by parity bytes. # Errors Returns an error if the combined output exceeds 255 symbols.",
