        "Return the dimensionless heat-bath conditional probabilities in Potts color order for one zero-based site. Read the current neighborhood without changing spins or the seed stream. Writes the single-site heat-bath conditional probabilities in color order. The output has one entry per color. Probabilities use shifted log weights and include the infinite-coupling limits. The model and RNG are read-only. # Errors Returns an error for an invalid site, output length, local spin label or undefined effective coupling.",
