        "`pid_tune(num, den, rule, lambda)`: `list(kp, ki, kd)` from a first-order-plus-dead-time model of the plant; `rule` is `ziegler_nichols`, `cohen_coon`, `imc`, `amigo` or `chien_hrones_reswick`. Tunes a PID controller for `plant` with the selected rule. `lambda` is the closed-loop time constant of the IMC rule; it is ignored by the other rules and defaults to `max(0.1 tau, theta)`. # Errors Returns an error when the plant step response does not identify a finite first-order-plus-dead-time model or when `lambda` is not positive.",
        "`pinv(A)`: Moore-Penrose pseudoinverse `A^+` of matrix `A`. Moore-Penrose pseudo-inverse through the SVD. # Errors As [`svd`].",
        "`planck_law(nu, T)`: Planck blackbody spectral radiance at frequency `nu` and temperature `T`.",
        "`plasma_frequency(n, e, eps, m)`: plasma angular frequency `sqrt(n e^2 / (eps m))`.",
