        "`sdp_solve(c, f0, fs, a, rel, b, max_iter)`: `list(x, objective, iterations, primal_residual, dual_residual, min_eigenvalue)` minimising `c . x` subject to `F_0 + sum x_i F_i >= 0` and the equality rows `a x = b`. Solves a semidefinite program by SDPAD. # Errors Returns an error string when the dimensions disagree, when an entry is not finite, when `max_iter` is zero, or when the `x`-update system is singular.",
